# Audited: Work's entry, Add2 entered, Inc twice in Add2, Apply, Inc1 entered and Inc in Inc1 are the seven cycles, by D6 as ruled (a call of an unbounded lambda is a cycle point); 1 + 2 + 1 = 4.
# The unbounded lambdas' tests: declarations of be-unbounded-lambda.prism (Semantics chapter 6).

test lambdas_are_jobs_too, @Counted 1:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="working")
    compute until idle
        => expect Ui.Label(text="4")
